+          type="checkbox"
+          checked={remember}
+          onChange={(e) => setRemember(e.target.checked)}
+        />
+        {zh
+          ? "将口令保存在本机钥匙串"
+          : "Remember the password in this device’s Keychain"}
+      </label>
+      <p className="text-xs text-muted-foreground">
+        {zh
+          ? "未勾选保存时，口令仅在本次运行中保留。其他设备下载加密快照时需要相同口令。错误口令或文件篡改会在恢复前被拒绝。"
